      "value": "I've also had this issue exclusively in open beta, I thought I was going crazy! It seems to happen semi-randomly, and in my case has still happened in worlds where I'm running at my full frame rate (144 fps). I can also confirm that the issue does not seem to happen in live branch for me either.",
